uires a cursory glance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T16:30:28-08:00","id":820637,"title":"","content":"Not Dreamspeakers either? Or did I miss something somewhere, too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T16:49:13-08:00","id":820642,"title":"","content":"Cryptologos fill the FC slot<br /> <br /> Orphans of Proteus fill the Thyrsus slot.<br /> <br /> So no Dreamspeakers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T18:27:58-08:00","id":820669,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/793530-which-legacies-do-you-want-in-the-post-release-batch?p=820637#post820637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not Dreamspeakers either? Or did I miss something somewhere, too?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dreamspeakers may be in the second batch he's got planned buuuut, no guarantee, no confirmation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8573-zombiecakes","name":"Zombiecakes","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-31T20:02:43-08:00","id":820693,"title":"","content":"I predict:<br /> The Dreamspeakers will need very little updating once we have 2e rules, so we will have an excellent unofficial version up before book 2 comes out.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Grump, grouse, and/or gripe.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/672-thenate","name":"thenate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar672_1.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"928"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T05:57:10-08:00","id":821575,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Juhn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/793530-which-legacies-do-you-want-in-the-post-release-batch?p=820496#post820496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cryptologos? That's a surprise. I was sure we were going to get Clavicularius/Bene Ashmedai.</div> </div> </div> </div> Yeah me too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T06:14:08-08:00","id":821579,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Juhn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/793530-which-legacies-do-you-want-in-the-post-release-batch?p=820496#post820496\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cryptologos? That's a surprise. I was sure we were going to get Clavicularius/Bene Ashmedai.</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine Sisterhood of the Blessed edged it out because he's done it already and it's SL.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T16:41:52-08:00","id":821968,"title":"","content":"Mmn. Cryptologos. I imagine that will look remarkably different now we have Instruments, and with theoretical Prime spells that manipulate them... Some of the orphaned concepts in the Free Council book deserved better, and this is one of them.<br /> <br /> Good first spread. Although I imagine we'll start immediately converting them once the corebook releases. (My soul for Powersmiths and Shards of Power)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1516-solarious","name":"Solarious","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1516_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T17:20:30-08:00","id":821996,"title":"","content":"I'm wondering; with Vulgar magic gone, are The Quiscent irrelevent? I suppose you could change them to a Legacy of mages that never ever Reach, but that's a bit of a shift in flavor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T17:40:18-08:00","id":822008,"title":"","content":"They certainly wouldn't be irrelevant, and their focus wouldn't change. They would simply seek to not use any magic that could catch the attention of Sleepers or the Abyss. Which is what they do in 1e, but without the Vulgar/Covert divide they're no longer unnecessarily hobbled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T20:02:19-08:00","id":822077,"title":"","content":"I really hoped for Brotherhood of Demon Wind, but looking at it now, I'm also pretty happy with Cryptologos. If I remember correctly, it was one of the Legacies that I found interesting in fluff, but terrible in mechanical design; them being updated means they might finally get playable and fun Attainments. Demon Wind is really easy to convert, so I guess it's better to see one that is harder converted instead of the &quot;instant update just add water&quot; easy peasy Wind.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/9102-whw","name":"WHW","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar9102_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2542"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-02T22:05:16-08:00","id":822125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Solarious</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/793530-which-legacies-do-you-want-in-the-post-release-batch?p=821968#post821968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mmn. Cryptologos. I imagine that will look remarkably different now we have Instruments, and with theoretical Prime spells that manipulate them... Some of the orphaned concepts in the Free Council book deserved better, and this is one of them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really interested in Cryptologos with new take on High Speech. Maybe it's them that want to bring HS in to Sleepers talk, like Awakened Languages in <b>Tome of Mysteries</b>?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T08:42:09-08:00","id":822426,"title":"","content":"What happened to using the Clavicarius/Bene Ashmedai as an example of a legacy that &quot;split&quot;?<br /> <br /> Come on Dave, you had almost confirmed that we'd be getting them converted months ago, <i>please </i>don't take that away from those of us who were looking forward to them<i>.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1200-doink","name":"Doink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T08:49:44-08:00","id":822433,"title":"","content":"Allow a guy to change his mind.<br /> <br /> Plus the SL slot was already filled by Sisterhood of the Blessed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T12:09:00-08:00","id":822581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Doink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/793530-which-legacies-do-you-want-in-the-post-release-batch?p=822426#post822426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What happened to using the Clavicarius/Bene Ashmedai as an example of a legacy that &amp;quot;split&amp;quot;?<br /> <br /> Come on Dave, you had almost confirmed that we'd be getting them converted months ago, <i>please </i>don't take that away from those of us who were looking forward to them<i>.</i></div> </div> </div> </div>Don't complain too hard about getting free stuff.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-03T12:54:12-08:00","id":822644,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Doink</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-d